Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Misugi mi? Sahanın Asili lakaplı\Nher yerde oynayabilen dahi bir oyuncu.{what is this, a video game? ikr, wtf with mulltiplayers}{this sounded funny: French subs call him "le prince des pelouses"=prince on the grass} {his name in official stuff is Noble of the Field}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsubasa-kun!
